Context
    DocumentVersion: 0.11.1-draft
    GrammarVersion: 1.0.1

Module
    Type: Module
    Role: Content
    Caption: PushAll (linear append of all elements; replaces quadratic concat-accumulation)

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: PushAll
        Params: acc, xs
        Returns: out
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: i
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: xs
            Returns: n
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: i, n
            Returns: cont
        Loop
            Condition: cont
            Body
                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: xs, i
                    Returns: e
                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Op: Core.ListPush
                    Params: acc, e
                    Returns: acc
                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: i, 1
                    Returns: i
                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: i, n
                    Returns: cont
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.Id
            Params: acc
            Returns: out
        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            State: Ok
            Returns: out
